        <span itemprop="subject">microporous multilayer separator membrane</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">that contains one or more polypropylene layer(s) and polyethylene layer(s) and that has good tensile and/or mechanical strength and that has low pin removal force that may enable high production yield rates in a battery cell winding process.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0007">
