        <span itemprop="subject">the present application or invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may address the above needs, problems or issues, and/or may provide novel or improved porous membranes, microporous membranes, battery separator membranes, multilayer membranes, laminated membranes, laminated multilayer membranes, and/or separators, and/or batteries or devices including such membranes or separators, and/or methods of making such membranes, separators, devices, and/or batteries, and/or methods of using such membranes, separators, devices, and/or batteries.</span>
