        <span itemprop="definition">may be required for optimal battery cell yields during the winding process step in the manufacture lithium rechargeable batteries, such as rechargeable lithium ion batteries.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0013">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the present application or invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is a laminated multilayer polyolefin microporous membrane which may include low coefficient of friction exterior layers made of polyethylene (PE) or a blend of various polyethylenes, or one or more copolymers of PE, and one or more interior polypropylene (PP) layers and may be stacked in alternating layers, for example, but not limited to, a polyethylene/polypropylene/polyethylene (PE/PP/PE) layered configuration.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0013">
