        <span itemprop="definition">is directed to a novel or improved microporous battery separator membranes, separators, batteries including such separators, methods of making such membranes, separators, and/or batteries, and/or methods of using such membranes, separators and/or batteries.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0097">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
